        {
          "name": "🎭 Mock Interview Evaluation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"{{job_id}}\",\n  \"action\": \"mock\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    \"Tell me about yourself and why you're interested in this position.\",\n    \"What are your greatest strengths and how do they apply to this role?\",\n    \"Describe a challenging project you worked on and how you overcame obstacles.\",\n    \"Where do you see yourself in 5 years?\",\n    \"Do you have any questions for us?\"\n  ],\n  \"answers\": [\n    \"I'm a passionate computer science student with strong experience in web development and data analysis. I'm excited about this position because it combines my technical skills with my interest in solving real-world problems. During my internships, I've developed skills in React, Python, and SQL that directly apply to this role.\",\n    \"My greatest strength is my ability to learn quickly and adapt to new technologies. For example, when I joined my last internship, I had to learn Vue.js in just two weeks to contribute to their main project. I was able to not only learn the framework but also implement two new features that improved user engagement by 15%.\",\n    \"During my capstone project, our team was tasked with building a full-stack application for local businesses. We faced a major challenge when our initial database design couldn't handle the complex relationships we needed. I took the initiative to research and propose a new schema design, collaborated with team members to implement the changes, and we successfully delivered the project on time with all required features.\",\n    \"In 5 years, I see myself as a senior developer leading technical projects and mentoring junior developers. I want to continue growing my technical expertise while also developing leadership skills. I'm particularly interested in specializing in cloud architecture and contributing to open-source projects that have meaningful impact.\",\n    \"Yes, I have a few questions. What does a typical day look like for someone in this position? What opportunities are there for professional development and learning new technologies? How does the team approach code reviews and knowledge sharing?\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
